        "chars": 857,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.41
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        198,
        882,
        1522,
        1072
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "§ 2. Cooperation in Planning and Implementing Stormwater Controls. Heads and staff of all mayoral agencies with any role in planning, designing, funding, implementing, operating, and/or maintaining stormwater controls affecting the City's combined sewer system and/or the City's MS4, together with the Department of Education (DOE) upon the written concurrence of the Chancellor or his or her designee, shall cooperate with DEP by:",
