      "category": "Text",
      "text": "§ 3. Funding of Costs. In the event of any additional or unforeseen costs to the City (including but not limited to costs related to remedial measures or resulting from enforcement actions) in relation to compliance with the City's Stormwater SPDES Permit Requirements that fall within the responsibilities, jurisdiction or authority of any mayoral agency, the affected agency and OMB shall cooperate to identify an appropriate source of funds to pay for such costs.",
